> +	if (!mtk_dp->train_info.cable_plugged_in ||
> +	    mtk_dp->train_info.irq_status & MTK_DP_HPD_DISCONNECT) {
> +		mtk_dp->train_state = MTK_DP_TRAIN_STATE_CHECKCAP;

Changing state here has no any effect, so drop this.

